  "prefLabel": "Rea 200 PRACTICE AND PROCEDURAL RULES",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Rea 200 PRACTICE AND PROCEDURAL RULES\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #14228, effective 3-19-25, repealed Part Rea 201 through Part Rea 207 in Chapter Rea 200, titled “Practice and Procedures”. Document #14228 also adopted a new Part Rea 201 titled “Practice and Procedures”, containing Rea 201.01 titled “Rules of Practice and Procedure.”\n\nDocument #14228 replaces all prior filings affecting the rules in the former Chapter Rea 200. The prior filings included the following documents:\n\n#7519, eff 6-28-01\n\n#7263, eff 5-6-00\n\n#9269-A, eff 9-17-08\n\n#12362, eff 8-16-17\n\n#12977-A, eff 1-23-20\n\nAs practice and procedure rules, the rules in Document #14228 will not expire except pursuant to RSA 541-A:17, II.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rea100-700.html"
